  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Sci-Fest-Science fiesta for students from 7th to 12th Standard</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\nATME College of Engineering is organizing <strong>“Sci-Fest-Science fiesta for students from 7th to 12th Standard”</strong>, funded by National Council for Science and Technology Communication, Department of Science and Technology, Govt. of India, in association with JSS PU College for Women, Chamarajanagara. The event is scheduled from <strong>23rd February – 25th February 2022 in JSS PU College for women, Chamarajanagara</strong>. As part of program six events will be conducted.  The following details of the events are as follows:\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Event name</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Registration Link-Google form</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Faculty coordinator</strong></td>\n<td><strong>WhatsApp Group link</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Essay Writing</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://forms.gle/zwSsrLh2ZKiuU6bJ9\">Click here</a></td>\n<td>Mr. Rudresh A N  – Asst. Professor, ATMECE, Mysuru.&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Ph. No: 9743580290</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/FPjEmoraX4I2yMb9BioouY\">Click here</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JAM(Just a Minute)-Pick and Speak</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://forms.gle/pw9sMw1AaBoZhoqd7\">Click here</a></td>\n<td>Mrs. Juslin F – Asst. Professor, ATMECE, Mysuru.&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Ph. No: 9036065420</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/FPjEmoraX4I2yMb9BioouY\">Click here</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Poster Presentation</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://forms.gle/ouWGhV1MBE8shzN77\">Click here</a></td>\n<td>Mr. Girish M – Asst. Professor, ATMECE, Mysuru.&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Ph. No: 9964406640</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/CZlIjXvvRYH9Cavs4j60JP\">Click here</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Hackathon-Instant IoT Project Building</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://forms.gle/PwN3iSqp8b43ANsL6\">Click here</a></td>\n<td>Ms. Anupama Shetter – Asst. Professor, ATMECE, Mysuru.&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Ph. No: 9738484396</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/B6NCrw2Sqj29eCv8RoNd9K\">Click here</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Science-Quiz</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://forms.gle/En1JwC2bZkcQZQ2b8\">Click here</a></td>\n<td>Mr. Pradeep Kumar Y  – Asst. Professor, ATMECE, Mysuru.&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Ph. No: 9986646017</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/HOjVNwvumhk544rwOpBBbw\">Click here</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Technical Project Exhibition</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://forms.gle/b4Zn1uk9ymfCbVNS9\">Click here</a></td>\n<td>Mr. Manjunath K  – Asst. Professor, ATMECE, Mysuru.&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Ph. No: 9738403734</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/DdpMVp9lpqgDrJ8cD6LxJW\">Click here</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>NOTE: Participants for any difficulty kindly contact the respective coordinators.</strong>\n<h2><strong><a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/broucher-ATME-CH-nager-1_compressed.pdf\">Download Brochure here</a></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/SciFest-report-Updated_compressed.pdf\"><strong>Report</strong></a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
